It may be a wonderful encounter.

People in the past said wise things.
“A child who sleeps well grows well."{VAR BE01}
Yes, if a Pokémon uses the move Rest,
the Pokémon will fall asleep and recover!{VAR BE01}
I already taught the move to my Pokémon,
so I will give this to you!{VAR BE01}

Even if a Pokémon falls asleep, I heard
there is a Berry to wake it up instantly.{VAR BE01}
If a Pokémon holds that Berry and uses
Rest, the Pokémon will fall asleep{VAR BE00}
and recover, then wake up instantly!{VAR BE01}
It's a great combination!
